<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 54-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 54-1 AT TEA V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 54 for one, 153 ahead, at tea on the third day of the second test against India on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores - Scores: South Africa 428 and 54-1, India 329 -- tea.</p>
